{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今午（28日）2時許，警方接獲何文田自由道一動物診所職員報案，指懷疑有狗隻遭不恰當對待。警員接報到場，發現狗隻眼部明顯受傷，職員稱當時一名男子帶該狗求醫，並指因家人抱不穩，致牠墮地受傷，該男子其後離開。案件仍在調查中，警方暫列殘酷對待動物，暫時沒有人被捕。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:15:39.632939+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:20:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:28.263442+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:09:16.236031+00:00","content_hash":"14b3ddf7448dce9fccf8b303eefc3d643d29e3274983da6f2979a4f0826adc4c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}